#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:1
msgid "Backup and recovery"
msgstr "备份与恢复"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:3
msgid ""
"Back up the agent database, its encryption keys and retained host state "
"together, as one recovery set. A database dump cannot rebuild a native "
"CLI session whose Docker writable layer was lost. Restorable checkpoints "
"in S3 cover only groups that stopped cleanly with archives on, and "
"CloudLab node rotation only moves a source that is still available; "
"neither replaces an off-node backup. The deployment owner provides backup"
" storage and scheduling; this guide installs no backup service and claims"
" no measured recovery times."
msgstr ""
"把 agent 数据库、它的加密密钥和保留的主机状态作为一个恢复集一起备份。Docker 可写层丢失后，数据库转储无法重建原生 CLI 会话。S3"
" 中的可恢复检查点只覆盖在开启归档时干净停止的组，CloudLab "
"节点轮换也只能迁移仍然可用的源节点；两者都不能代替节点外备份。备份存储和调度由部署负责人提供；本指南不安装任何备份服务，也不声称有实测的恢复时间。"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:11
msgid "Initial operating policy"
msgstr "初始的运维策略"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:13
msgid ""
"Use these targets until the deployment owner records others and proves "
"them with a restore drill. Alert on failed or late backups and on failed "
"integrity checks: retention alone meets no objective."
msgstr "在部署负责人记录其他目标并用恢复演练证明之前，使用下面的目标。备份失败或延迟、完整性检查失败时都要告警：光有保留期达不到任何目标。"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md
msgid "Recovery material"
msgstr "恢复材料"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md
msgid "Frequency and retention"
msgstr "频率和保留期"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md
msgid "Initial recovery objective"
msgstr "初始恢复目标"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md
msgid "Agent Postgres database"
msgstr "Agent 的 Postgres 数据库"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md
msgid ""
"Hourly encrypted dumps for 24 hours; daily copies for 30 days; monthly "
"copies for 3 months"
msgstr "每小时一次加密转储，保留 24 小时；每日一份，保留 30 天；每月一份，保留 3 个月"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md
msgid "Database recovery point at most 1 hour old"
msgstr "数据库最多丢失 1 小时的数据"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md
msgid "Coordinated database and retained host state"
msgstr "彼此对应的数据库和主机保留状态"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md
msgid "Daily off-node recovery set for 7 days; weekly set for 4 weeks"
msgstr "每天在节点外存一套恢复集，保留 7 天；每周一套，保留 4 周"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md
msgid "Native-session recovery point at most 24 hours old"
msgstr "原生会话最多丢失 24 小时的数据"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md
msgid ""
"Configuration, encryption keys, host credentials, SSH trust, release "
"locks and recipes"
msgstr "配置、加密密钥、主机凭据、SSH 信任、发布锁定文件和部署配方（recipe）"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md
msgid ""
"Capture with every recovery set and before every change; retain while any"
" dependent backup/release is retained"
msgstr "每做一套恢复集、每次变更之前都要采集一次；只要还有备份或发布依赖它，就一直保留"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md
msgid "Recover the exact keys and identities used by the selected set"
msgstr "能恢复出所选恢复集当时用的那批密钥和身份，一个不差"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md
msgid "Previous verified artifact release"
msgstr "上一个经过验证的产物发布"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md
msgid ""
"Keep the current and previous successful release, plus every release "
"referenced by retained recovery sets"
msgstr "保留当前和上一个成功的发布，以及所有被保留的恢复集引用到的发布"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md
msgid "Available without rebuilding or relying on mutable image tags"
msgstr "不用重新构建，也不依赖会变的镜像标签，随时能拿到"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:24
msgid ""
"The initial recovery-time target is 4 hours after choosing a usable set. "
"Large Docker stores can take longer, so measure copy and restore times "
"and revise the target. A restore that includes retained chats needs a "
"coherent host and database set, so hourly database dumps do not give a "
"1-hour native-session objective. For a shorter database recovery point, "
"use Postgres continuous WAL archiving."
msgstr ""
"初始的恢复时间目标是选定可用恢复集之后 4 小时。Docker "
"存储较大时可能更久，所以要实测复制和恢复的时间，并据此调整目标。包含保留对话的恢复需要一致的主机和数据库恢复集，所以每小时的数据库转储并不能带来 "
"1 小时的原生会话恢复点。需要更短的数据库恢复点时，使用 Postgres 的连续 WAL 归档。"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:31
msgid ""
"Keep encrypted backups off the machines and CloudLab allocation they "
"protect. Restrict access, keep decryption material apart from the "
"backups, watch free space, and verify hashes after transfer. Do not "
"delete an encryption key or registry image that a retained set still "
"needs."
msgstr ""
"加密的备份不要放在它所保护的机器和 CloudLab "
"分配上。限制访问，把解密材料与备份分开存放，关注剩余空间，传输后校验哈希。不要删除仍被某个保留恢复集需要的加密密钥或 registry 镜像。"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:36
msgid "What belongs in a recovery set"
msgstr "一套恢复集里要有什么"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:38
msgid ""
"Record a set ID, start and end times (UTC), source host identities, "
"source commit, database revision, deployment protocol, Docker and "
"storage-driver versions, data-root paths, container inventory, file "
"hashes and the release manifest hash: identifiers only, never prompts, "
"tokens or credentials. Preserve, privately:"
msgstr ""
"记录恢复集 ID、开始和结束时间（UTC）、源主机身份、源 commit、数据库版本、部署协议、Docker "
"和存储驱动版本、数据根路径、容器清单、文件哈希以及发布清单的哈希：只记标识，绝不记录提示词、令牌或凭据。以下内容要私密保存："

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:44
msgid ""
"**A full Postgres backup** of the agent database, including settings, the"
" identity namespace, hosts, placement, jobs, attempts, connections and "
"compute records; never just the conversation tables."
msgstr ""
"agent 数据库的**完整 Postgres "
"备份**，包括设置、身份命名空间、主机、放置、任务、attempt、连接和计算记录；绝不能只备份对话相关的表。"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:47
msgid ""
"**The deployment keys, apart from the database.** The `agent-keys` volume"
" holds `AGENT_SETTINGS_ENCRYPTION_KEY` (or the original "
"`AGENT_SESSION_SECRET` root), the account key and the database "
"connection. Export them only to the encrypted backup storage:"
msgstr ""
"**部署密钥，与数据库分开保存**。`agent-keys` 卷中保存着 "
"`AGENT_SETTINGS_ENCRYPTION_KEY`（或原来作为根密钥的 "
"`AGENT_SESSION_SECRET`）、账号密钥和数据库连接。只把它们导出到加密的备份存储中："

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:56
msgid ""
"On a replacement machine, that file used as the deployment's `.env` "
"restores them at the first start. Also keep each deployment root's "
"`.env`, where one exists, and mounted credential files: source-control "
"and compute encryption keys, signing secrets, sandbox manager credentials"
" and GitHub App keys. Keys held in saved settings still need the settings"
" root key to decrypt, and generating new keys recovers nothing."
msgstr ""
"在替换机器上，把这个文件用作部署的 `.env`，第一次启动时就能恢复这些密钥。还要保存每个部署根目录下的 "
"`.env`（如果有）以及挂载的凭据文件：源码托管和计算凭据的加密密钥、签名 secret、sandbox manager 凭据和 GitHub "
"App 密钥。保存在设置中的密钥仍需设置根密钥才能解密，生成新密钥无法恢复任何东西。"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:62
msgid ""
"**Each host's state**: the enrollment credential directory and deployment"
" identity, `.deployed-sha`, readiness marker, namespace and project, "
"tunnel SSH credentials and verified `known_hosts`, and runtime and "
"storage configuration. The credential must match the restored host row's "
"credential hash."
msgstr ""
"**每台主机的状态**：注册凭据目录和部署身份、`.deployed-sha`、就绪标记、命名空间和项目、隧道 SSH 凭据和经过验证的 "
"`known_hosts`，以及运行时和存储配置。凭据必须与恢复后的主机记录中的凭据哈希一致。"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:67
msgid ""
"**The complete retained Docker store and containerd image store**: "
"`<disk>/docker` and `<disk>/containerd` in the supported bind layout, "
"while `docker info` still reports `DockerRootDir=/var/lib/docker`. Copy "
"both with Docker and containerd stopped, preserving ownership, modes, "
"hard links, extended attributes and sparse files, and keep the matching "
"database: a container filesystem export alone lacks the thread-to-host-"
"to-container identities. A read-only Docker socket does not make raw "
"overlay copying safe ([retained Docker storage](operations.md#retained-"
"docker-storage-on-a-host))."
msgstr ""
"**完整的保留 Docker 存储和 containerd 镜像存储**：在官方的绑定挂载布局下是 `<disk>/docker` 和 "
"`<disk>/containerd`，而 `docker info` 报告的仍是 "
"`DockerRootDir=/var/lib/docker`。在 Docker 和 containerd "
"都停止时复制两者，保留属主、权限、硬链接、扩展属性和稀疏文件，并保存与之匹配的数据库：单独导出容器文件系统，缺少对话到主机再到容器的身份对应关系。只读的"
" Docker socket 并不能让直接复制 overlay 变得安全（见[保留的 Docker 存储](operations.md"
"#retained-docker-storage-on-a-host)）。"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:75
msgid ""
"**Release material** for the current and previous serving releases: the "
"verified `release.json`, its pinned SHA-256, `recipe.tar.gz`, the "
"extracted recipe, helper dependencies and image digests, with the digest-"
"addressed images kept in the registry or a tested private archive."
msgstr ""
"当前和上一个在线版本的**发布材料**：经过验证的 `release.json`、它的固定 "
"SHA-256、`recipe.tar.gz`、解压后的配方、辅助依赖和镜像 digest，并把按 digest 寻址的镜像保留在 "
"registry 或经过测试的私有归档中。"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:80
msgid ""
"Never put these backups in the repository or attach credential archives "
"to issues or CI logs."
msgstr "绝不要把这些备份放进仓库，也不要把凭据归档附在 issue 或 CI 日志里。"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:83
msgid "Capture a coordinated set"
msgstr "采集一套彼此对应的恢复集"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:85
msgid ""
"Record the deployment markers, placement, host status, container "
"inventory and encryption-key version identifiers. In a maintenance "
"window, stop new admissions and admin configuration changes, drain the "
"hosts and wait for active attempts to finish. Note which hosts were "
"already draining or disabled."
msgstr ""
"记录部署标记、放置、主机状态、容器清单和加密密钥的版本标识。在维护窗口内停止新的准入和管理配置修改，排空主机，等待活跃的 attempt "
"结束。记下哪些主机原本就处于排空或停用状态。"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:90
msgid ""
"Stop the main API and MCP listener, which also stops compute "
"reconciliation and background writers. Stop the retained sandbox "
"containers and each host stack, then `docker.socket`, Docker and "
"containerd. No source host may write while its set is captured."
msgstr ""
"停止主 API 和 MCP 监听进程，这也会停止计算资源对账和后台写入。停止保留的沙箱容器和每台主机上的服务，然后停止 "
"`docker.socket`、Docker 和 containerd。采集恢复集期间，任何源主机都不得写入。"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:94
msgid ""
"With the listeners stopped, take a full database dump from the control-"
"plane deployment root, with the generated Compose file and project "
"selected. It writes no credentials to the output:"
msgstr "在监听进程停止的状态下，从控制平面的部署根目录做一次完整的数据库转储，并选中生成的 Compose 文件和项目。它不会把任何凭据写到输出中："

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:108
msgid ""
"It dumps `POSTGRES_DB`, the database `AGENT_POSTGRES_DB` names, which is "
"the deployment's database only while `AGENT_DATABASE_URL` uses it too: "
"confirm that `docker compose logs keys` for this project shows no "
"`AGENT_POSTGRES_DB` warning. Capture the configuration and the stopped "
"host storage into the same set with your encrypted backup tooling, "
"transfer it off-node, record hashes, and check that the archive and dump "
"are readable."
msgstr ""
"它转储的是 `POSTGRES_DB`，即 `AGENT_POSTGRES_DB` 指定的数据库；只有 `AGENT_DATABASE_URL` "
"也使用它时，它才是这个部署的数据库：请确认这个项目的 `docker compose logs keys` 中没有关于 "
"`AGENT_POSTGRES_DB` "
"的警告。用你的加密备份工具把配置和已停止的主机存储采集到同一个恢复集中，传到节点之外，记录哈希，并确认归档和转储都可读。"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:114
msgid ""
"Start the daemons and both listeners, then the host stacks, and run the "
"host checks; their live probes need the API and MCP listener. Verify "
"identity, sandbox manager access and readiness, restore only the drain "
"states you changed, and reopen admissions. A failed backup never "
"justifies deleting or replacing the source state."
msgstr ""
"启动守护进程和两个监听进程，再启动各主机上的服务，运行主机检查；这些检查的实时探测需要 API 和 MCP 监听进程。确认身份、sandbox "
"manager 访问和就绪状态，只恢复你改过的排空状态，然后重新开放准入。备份失败绝不能成为删除或替换源状态的理由。"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:120
msgid ""
"An hourly database-only dump can run while Postgres serves; `pg_dump` "
"takes a consistent snapshot. Label it database-only, and never pair it "
"with a host snapshot from another time as a coherent native-session "
"restore."
msgstr ""
"每小时一次的纯数据库转储可以在 Postgres 提供服务时进行；`pg_dump` "
"会取得一致的快照。把它标记为纯数据库备份，绝不要把它和另一时间点的主机快照拼在一起，当作一致的原生会话恢复。"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:124
msgid "Restore and verify before reopening"
msgstr "恢复，并在重新开放前验证"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:126
msgid ""
"Keep ingress closed and replacement host daemons stopped. Isolate "
"recovered compute controllers from provider side effects until "
"allocations are reconciled, because an old database can refer to expired "
"allocations. Confirm the source hosts are stopped or fenced: two machines"
" must never serve the same host credential and namespace."
msgstr "保持入口关闭，替换主机上的守护进程保持停止。在分配对账完成之前，让恢复出来的计算控制器无法对服务商产生副作用，因为旧数据库可能引用已过期的分配。确认源主机已停止或已被栅栏隔离：两台机器绝不能同时使用同一个主机凭据和命名空间提供服务。"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:131
msgid ""
"Verify the set's hashes and decryption material, and restore into an "
"isolated database first, with a compatible Postgres and the selected "
"release. Restore the matching configuration and root keys before starting"
" a listener. A settings root key in the environment that differs from the"
" stored one stops the start, because the `keys` service never replaces a "
"root. Only when the environment's key is the one the settings were saved "
"with, delete the stored file first, using the Postgres image the "
"deployment pins so nothing new is pulled:"
msgstr ""
"校验恢复集的哈希和解密材料，先用兼容的 Postgres "
"和选定的版本恢复到一个隔离的数据库。启动监听进程之前，恢复匹配的配置和根密钥。环境变量中的设置根密钥与已保存的不同时，启动会停止，因为 "
"`keys` 服务从不替换根密钥。只有确认环境变量中的密钥正是保存设置时用的那一把，才先删除已保存的文件；使用部署固定的 Postgres "
"镜像，这样不会拉取任何新东西："

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:144
msgid ""
"A deployment that serves the restored database on the bundled `postgres` "
"service sets `AGENT_POSTGRES_DB` to its name along with "
"`AGENT_DATABASE_URL`. The database must be bound to the account system; a"
" Gateway-era one is refused and stays an archive ([old "
"databases](operations.md#preserving-an-old-chain-database)). Do not "
"improvise an Alembic downgrade."
msgstr ""
"在自带的 `postgres` 服务上使用恢复出来的数据库时，要把 `AGENT_POSTGRES_DB` 和 "
"`AGENT_DATABASE_URL` "
"一起设为它的名称。数据库必须绑定到账号体系；网关时代的数据库会被拒绝，只作为归档保留（见[旧数据库](operations.md"
"#preserving-an-old-chain-database)）。不要临时自行做 Alembic 降级。"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:150
msgid ""
"Restore the complete stopped host state with a compatible Docker and "
"storage driver and the right mounts, checking the mounts before starting "
"Docker. Keep the matching enrollment credential, namespace and container "
"IDs. Start and inspect the daemon without admitting tasks; do not run "
"generic prune or orphan cleanup to make mismatched state look empty."
msgstr ""
"用兼容的 Docker 和存储驱动以及正确的挂载，恢复完整的已停止主机状态，启动 Docker 之前先检查挂载。保留匹配的注册凭据、命名空间和容器"
" ID。在不接收任务的情况下启动并检查守护进程；不要运行通用的 prune 或孤儿清理，把不匹配的状态弄得像是空的。"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:155
msgid ""
"Compare each retained group's database owner and container identity with "
"the restored Docker labels, and reconcile stale attempts, leases and "
"compute operations through their supported recovery paths. A missing "
"container or a credential mismatch is a blocked recovery, not a sign that"
" another host can recreate the session."
msgstr ""
"把每个保留组在数据库中的所有者和容器身份与恢复出的 Docker 标签对比，并通过各自支持的恢复路径，对账过期的 "
"attempt、租约和计算操作。容器缺失或凭据不匹配意味着恢复受阻，而不是说明另一台主机可以重建会话。"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:160
msgid ""
"Run namespace verification and the Kata and candidate checks, then the "
"phased deployment sequence, listeners before host live checks. Once those"
" pass, set only hosts that were eligible for work back to `online`; the "
"readiness fence needs an online host and reverse sandbox manager probes. "
"This can resume work already queued in the restored database. With "
"external ingress still closed, check with disposable conversations: sign-"
"in, file access, retained continuation, separate Fork context, a queued "
"turn, cancellation, a pull request the agent opens, and a host restart. "
"Reopen admissions only after these checks and external health and queue "
"monitoring pass."
msgstr ""
"运行命名空间验证以及 Kata "
"和候选检查，再按分阶段的部署顺序进行，先启动监听进程，再做主机实时检查。这些都通过后，只把原本可以接收工作的主机设回 "
"`online`；就绪栅栏需要一台在线的主机和反向 sandbox manager "
"探测。这可能会恢复执行恢复出的数据库中已经排队的工作。在外部入口仍然关闭的情况下，用一次性对话检查：登录、文件访问、保留会话续接、独立的 Fork"
" 上下文、排队的轮次、取消、agent 创建的拉取请求，以及主机重启。只有这些检查和外部的健康与队列监控都通过之后，才重新开放准入。"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:170
msgid ""
"Run an isolated restore drill quarterly and after changing storage "
"topology, key handling or the deployment protocol. Record the set and "
"release IDs, checks, elapsed time, lost-data window and failures, without"
" secrets. A static test, a readable dump, a manual node rotation or a "
"backup hash is not a drill."
msgstr ""
"每季度，以及更改存储拓扑、密钥处理方式或部署协议之后，做一次隔离的恢复演练。记录恢复集和版本 "
"ID、检查项、耗时、丢失数据的时间窗口和失败情况，不要记录 secret。静态测试、可读的转储、手动节点轮换或备份哈希都不算演练。"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:175
msgid ""
"Moving retained sessions to another host needs a compatible full host-"
"state restore. The exception is a stopped group whose [restorable "
"checkpoint](operations.md#restoring-a-removed-hosts-sandboxes) is in S3: "
"once its host is removed from the pool, its node is confirmed terminated,"
" or the host moves out before its lease ends, another host restores it on"
" the group's next turn. If the source disk, its off-node copy and any "
"checkpoint are all lost, native context cannot be recovered from "
"Postgres."
msgstr ""
"把保留会话迁到另一台主机，需要兼容的完整主机状态恢复。例外是[可恢复检查点](operations.md#restoring-a-removed-"
"hosts-sandboxes)在 S3 "
"中的已停止组：一旦它的主机被移出池子、节点被确认已终止，或主机在租期结束前迁出，另一台主机会在这个组的下一个轮次恢复它。如果源磁盘、它的节点外副本和所有检查点都丢失了，就无法从"
" Postgres 恢复原生上下文。"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:183
msgid "Recover a previous artifact release"
msgstr "恢复到上一个产物发布"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:185
msgid ""
"The host deployer is handed one release and does not restore an older "
"manifest by itself. Keep each previous verified release in its own "
"immutable directory outside `DEPLOY_ROOT`, with the reviewed lock, and "
"never overwrite it with a failed candidate."
msgstr ""
"主机部署程序每次只拿到一个版本，不会自己恢复旧的清单。把之前每个经过验证的版本连同审查过的锁文件，各自放在 `DEPLOY_ROOT` "
"之外一个不可变的目录中，绝不要用失败的候选版本覆盖它。"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:190
msgid ""
"Before rolling back, verify the previous manifest's pinned hash, the "
"recipe hash, registry digests, platforms and labels, and the deployment "
"protocol. Check the candidate's `compatibility.verified_rollback_to` "
"against the previous commit, and the previous release against the "
"database now installed; empty compatibility records prove nothing. An "
"older recipe must not run migrations backwards or cross the deployment-"
"protocol fence. Database preparation runs `upgrade head` from the "
"selected recipe, and Alembic refuses unknown newer revisions, so verify "
"this against the current schema in isolation. If it is refused, do not "
"delete or stamp migration history; use an explicitly tested compatible "
"recipe or a full stopped-writer recovery."
msgstr ""
"回滚之前，核对上一个清单的固定哈希、配方哈希、registry digest、平台和标签，以及部署协议。对照上一个 commit 检查候选版本的 "
"`compatibility.verified_rollback_to`，并检查上一个版本与当前已安装的数据库是否兼容；空的兼容性记录什么也证明不了。旧配方不能反向执行迁移，也不能跨越部署协议栅栏。数据库准备会用选定的配方运行"
" `upgrade head`，而 Alembic 会拒绝未知的更新版本，所以要先在隔离环境中对照当前 schema 验证。如果被拒绝，不要删除或"
" stamp 迁移历史；请使用经过明确测试的兼容配方，或做一次停止所有写入方的完整恢复。"

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:201
msgid ""
"For a compatible rollback, on **each** machine select its previously "
"verified directory and stable deployment root:"
msgstr "确认兼容、准备回滚时，在**每台**机器上指定它之前验证过的发布目录和固定的部署根目录："

#: ../developer/disaster-recovery.md:212
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Then run the [phased deployment sequence](releases.md#rolling-out-both-"
"machines) with `\"${RECOVERY_RELEASE}/recipe/deploy/control-"
"plane/deploy.sh\"` on the control-plane machine and "
"`\"${RECOVERY_RELEASE}/recipe/deploy/host/deploy.sh\"` on its execution "
"host: prepare both, prepare the database, activate the host, then "
"activate the control plane. Every exact-generation and isolation check "
"still applies. Afterwards, read both `.deployed-sha` files and host "
"readiness, verify retained continuation and sandbox manager access before"
" reopening traffic, and record the incident as a failed candidate rollout"
" even though the previous release serves again."
msgstr ""
"然后按[分阶段的部署顺序](releases.md#rolling-out-both-machines)执行，在控制平面机器上使用 "
"`\"${RECOVERY_RELEASE}/recipe/deploy/control-"
"plane/deploy.sh\"`，在它的执行主机上使用 "
"`\"${RECOVERY_RELEASE}/recipe/deploy/host/deploy.sh\"`：准备两台机器，准备数据库，激活主机，再激活控制平面。所有确切代号和隔离检查依然有效。完成后，读取两个"
" `.deployed-sha` 文件和主机就绪状态，在重新开放流量之前确认保留会话续接和 sandbox manager "
"访问正常，并把这次事件记为候选版本上线失败，即使上一个版本已重新提供服务。"

